    <code>@graphiql/plugin-query-builder</code>. Remove the Explorer
    dependency and plugin registration when upgrading. Query Builder is
    included in GraphiQL's default plugin set; if you supply a custom
    <code>plugins</code> array, add <code>QUERY_BUILDER_PLUGIN</code> from
    <code>graphiql</code> to retain query-building support.</p>
    </li>
    <li>
    <p><a
    href="https://redirect.github.com/graphql/graphiql/pull/4566">#4566</a>
    <a
