    matching <code>monaco-graphql</code> major. See the <a
    href="https://github.com/graphql/graphiql/blob/c2e792bc446d5d6751bd7cd1d9ac283a4a1d8fc4/docs/migration/graphiql-6.0.0.md#monaco-editor-056-and-057-worker-setup">GraphiQL
